COURSE CONTENT

The course text (lessons, dialogues, readings, phrasebook, glosses and notes)
is written for Tinta.

Word frequency. The order of the frequency deck (the `freq` column of
content/lexicon/frequency.tsv) is derived from counts in the OpenSubtitles
2018 Spanish word list of the FrequencyWords project by Hermit Dave
(https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords), whose list content is
licensed CC BY-SA 4.0. Only a ranking was derived; no text of the list is
reproduced. WHETHER THAT RANKING CARRIES THE LIST'S SHARE-ALIKE TERMS IS
STILL TO BE DECIDED before any public release. The method and the manual
adjustments are described in content-plan/deck/README.md.

Verb reference (tests only). tools/packc/tests/fetch_reference.py downloads
Fred Jehle's Spanish verb database (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0) into build/ to check the
conjugator. It is not committed and nothing from it ships.
